# CI build fix (2026-11-23): Root.tsx imports 7 more components whose files
# were never committed, so every CI bundle failed after v18 (first failure:
# v19 run 45090721652, "Can't resolve './Gta6Script2En'"). Same precedent as
# gta6-pc above: commit ONLY the components + their words JSONs so the repo
# builds; their clips stay on the VM (VM renders only).
!public/batch6/gta5-last-ride/
!public/batch6/gta5-last-ride/words-en.json
!public/batch6/gta6-pc-rumors/
!public/batch6/gta6-pc-rumors/words-en.json
# CI build fix 2 (2026-11-25): the v25 CI render failed with "Can't resolve
# './Gta6Top5WtfPart2En'" — Root.tsx imports 3 more GTA components created
# 2026-11-24/25 (Top5 Part2, Top5 Part3, TeleporterNpc) that were never
# committed. Same precedent: components + words JSONs only, clips on the VM.
!public/batch6/gta6-top5-wtf-part2/
!public/batch6/gta6-top5-wtf-part2/words/
!public/batch6/gta6-top5-wtf-part2/words/words-en-part2.json
